Package: brightery-doctor
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}
Description: Read-only diagnostic dashboard for Linux servers
 Brightery Doctor samples CPU, memory pressure, disk I/O and Linux
 process state to identify potential performance bottlenecks.
 It shows colored terminal status indicators and can generate an
 offline HTML health report without a background daemon or network
 listener. Python standard-library dependencies only.
